{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01728","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行行游且猎篇 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 行行游且猎篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边城儿，生年不读一字书，但知游猎夸轻趫。\n胡马秋肥宜白草，骑来蹑影何矜骄。\n金鞭拂云挥鸣鞘，半酣呼鹰出远郊。\n弓弯满月不虚发，双鶬迸落连飞𩩉\n海边观者皆辟易，猛气英风振沙碛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}